This directory contains the JoyAI-Image-Edit inference stack used as the frozen teacher:
the MMDiT transformer, the Wan VAE wrapper, text-encoder glue, scheduler, pipeline and the
inference runtime (infer_runtime/). No weights are included.

Third-party code inside (see NOTICE):
- modules/models/attention.py, modules/utils/fsdp_load.py: adapted from FastVideo
  (https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo), Apache-2.0.
- modules/models/pipeline.py, modules/models/scheduler.py: derived from Hugging Face diffusers,
  Apache-2.0.
- modules/models/mmdit/vae/wanvae.py: Wan2.1 VAE, Apache-2.0.

Local modifications:
- imports rewritten to live under i2vt.vendor.joyedit; modules/utils/utils.py adds that prefix to
  the `modules.` class paths it builds from configs, and infer_runtime/infer_config.py rewrites the
  imports of a checkpoint's Python config the same way;
- modules/models/attention.py: implements the torch SDPA fallback the module advertises,
  so the teacher runs without flash-attn;
- modules/models/pipeline.py: uses `_execution_device` instead of `transformer.device`, so the
  call is built on the right device under model CPU offload.
